	(text "K-12: TPS62840 for 3.3 V on Rev B. Taken from VBAT (not from the 48 V chain), as decided for Rev A.\nBelow about 3.4 V in, the buck runs in 100 % mode and 3V3 follows VBAT (E-02 >=3.0 V while dosing; S-13 3.4 V stop).\nNote CF-8: E-02 wording says 'LDO' (Rev A); Rev B uses the decided TPS62840 buck."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15 20 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top))
